# CHAPTER II

## TECHNICAL STUDY

### DASH — CAMPUS CONNECT

This chapter presents the technical plan for the design, development, and deployment of Dash (Campus Connect). It describes the required hardware, software, and human resources; explains the technology choices; outlines the platform architecture; and details the operational means used to ensure security, reliability, and scalability.

