## 2.3 Hardware Resources

### 2.3.1 Development Hardware — Minimum Recommendation

- **CPU:** 4 cores minimum (8 cores preferred for faster build times)
- **RAM:** 8 GB minimum (16 GB preferred for running multiple dev services)
- **Storage:** SSD with at least 20–50 GB free space
- **Network:** Stable internet connection for package installation and cloud connectivity

### 2.3.2 Deployment Infrastructure — Production Target

- **Web hosting:** Vercel with automatic SSL and global CDN
- **Database & backend:** Supabase managed infrastructure (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage, Realtime)
- **CDN / Edge caching:** Vercel Edge Network for static assets
- **Uptime target:** 98%+

